## 📂 Dataset Information

**File Name:** `insurance.csv`

The dataset contains information about individuals and their insurance expenses.

### Features

| Column | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `age` | Age of the individual |
| `sex` | Gender of the individual |
| `bmi` | Body Mass Index |
| `children` | Number of children/dependents covered |
| `smoker` | Whether the person is a smoker |
| `region` | Residential region |
| `charges` | Medical insurance charges (Target Variable) |

